    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "pattern_check",
      "output_key": "pattern",
      "prompt": "Contract: {{question}}\nGame state: {{game}}\nCurrent book: {{quote}}\nMinute bars: {{path}}\nRecent prints: {{tape}}\n\nIdentify whether ANY of these three tradeable patterns exists RIGHT NOW:\n\n1. ACTIVE POST-GOAL SPIKE FADE (rare, very short window):\n   - A goal was scored in the last 1-3 minutes (check recent_events timestamp and candlestick volume spike)\n   - Price spiked 10+ cents and has NOT yet drifted back to pre-spike\n   - Pattern: -1 to -3c fade over next 5 min as book digests\n   - If the goal was >4 minutes ago OR price already drifted back, this pattern is NOT active\n\n2. LATE-MATCH TIME DECAY (the most reliable, but narrow conditions):\n   - Score is NOT level (one team leads)\n   - Clock shows <25 minutes remaining in the match (check period and clock)\n   - For the TRAILING team's contract: -0.5 to -2c per 5 min\n   - For the LEADING team's contract: +0.5 to +2c per 5 min\n   - Magnitude depends on current price (stronger at mid-range prices, weaker at extremes)\n   - If score is level OR >25 min remain, this pattern does NOT apply\n\n3. THIN-BOOK DRIFT BACK (uncommon):\n   - A single large order moved the mid 2+ cents in the last 5-10 minutes\n   - Volume in that minute was 3x+ normal\n   - No goal or card to justify the move\n   - Pattern: -1 to -2c drift back toward prior level\n\nCheck each pattern's conditions carefully. Most of the time (early in match, level score, goal absorbed, stable book) NONE of these patterns exist.\n\nBe strict: if clock >25 min remain, time decay does NOT exist yet. If a goal was >4 min ago, spike fade is over. If the book has been stable, there's no drift pattern.",
      "tools": [],
      "max_tool_iterations": 0,
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "minutes_remaining": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Minutes left in match (90 min total, account for period)"
          },
          "active_pattern": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["post_goal_fade", "time_decay", "book_drift", "none"],
            "description": "Which pattern exists right now, or none"
          },
          "pattern_confidence": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["strong", "weak"],
            "description": "How clearly the pattern conditions are met"
          },
          "pattern_reasoning": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Why this pattern exists or why none exists. Be specific about timing, score, and price action."
          }
        },
        "required": ["minutes_remaining", "active_pattern", "pattern_confidence", "pattern_reasoning"],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "predict",
      "output_key": "prediction",
      "prompt": "Pattern analysis: {{pattern}}\nCurrent book: {{quote}}\nGame: {{game}}\n\nForecast the 5-minute delta_cents:\n\nIF pattern.active_pattern == \"none\":\n  - Predict delta_cents = 0\n  - Set half_width_cents = 2 to 3 (acknowledging normal book noise)\n  - Confidence = 0.5 to 0.7 (predicting no-change is a real call)\n  - Most of the time, especially early in matches or with level scores, the right answer is zero.\n\nIF pattern.active_pattern == \"time_decay\" AND pattern_confidence == \"strong\":\n  - If this contract is for the TRAILING team: predict -0.5 to -2c depending on current price level\n  - If this contract is for the LEADING team: predict +0.5 to +2c depending on current price level\n  - Magnitude: stronger at 20-60c range, weaker at extremes (<10c or >80c)\n  - Set half_width_cents = 1.5 to 2.5\n  - Confidence = 0.6 to 0.75\n\nIF pattern.active_pattern == \"post_goal_fade\" AND pattern_confidence == \"strong\":\n  - Predict -1 to -3c fade back toward pre-spike level\n  - Check candlesticks to see how much it already faded\n  - Set half_width_cents = 2 to 3\n  - Confidence = 0.5 to 0.65\n\nIF pattern.active_pattern == \"book_drift\":\n  - Predict -1 to -2c drift back\n  - Set half_width_cents = 2.5 to 3.5\n  - Confidence = 0.4 to 0.55\n\nIF pattern_confidence == \"weak\" on any pattern:\n  - Reduce magnitude by 50% or predict 0\n  - Widen half_width by 0.5-1c\n\nRemember: delta_cents is the CHANGE (positive or negative), not an absolute price. Zero is a valid and often correct prediction.",
      "tools": [],
      "max_tool_iterations": 0,
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "delta_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "How many cents the mid will MOVE over the next five minutes. Negative for down, positive for up, 0 when no pattern exists."
          },
          "half_width_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Half the width of your two-sided quote, in cents. Tighter (1.5-2.5) for strong patterns, wider (2.5-3.5) for weak/none."
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "0-1 scale. Around 0.5-0.7 for none, 0.6-0.75 for strong patterns."
          },
          "driver": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Name the specific pattern driving your call, or explicitly state why nothing will move it."
          },
          "falsifier": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "What would prove this forecast wrong before settlement."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "delta_cents",
          "half_width_cents",
          "confidence",
          "driver",
          "falsifier"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    }
  ]
}
